URL: https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/util-linux/v2.42/util-linux-2.42.4.tar.xz f469475f55e55cb26253f2e106363523dbe5a5d48fc97780eee4c6864df23d2f
Origname: util-linux-2.42.4
Name: yolo-util-linux

    util-linux 2.42.4 for yolo (non-Fil-C) builds, unpatched.  The lsfd
    bsearch compound-literal fix this project used to carry (upstream
    commit 711bda1441561bfd2eb6d45fe0bc789535c1f1a8, needed because
    pristine glibc 2.44 defines a const-preserving bsearch macro with 5
    parameters (C23) and lsfd passed a compound literal whose internal
    comma was not protected by parentheses) is incorporated upstream as
    of 2.42, which also moves lsfd's sources to lsfd-cmd/; the Fil-C
    glibc forks defuse __glibc_const_generic, so the Fil-C build never
    hit this anyway.
